#, php-format
msgid "The \"%s\" trigger"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/class-catalog-abilities.php:233
msgid "WooCommerce triggers are part of Notification Master Pro. On this install only the free triggers are available; call notification-master/list-triggers for the list."
